{"id":"31a056a0868abd94","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp.md","title":"多项式长命题证明与 NP=coNP","display":"thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp — 多项式长命题证明与 NP=coNP","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp","aliases":["28-thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp"],"display":"thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp — 多项式长命题证明与 NP=coNP","depends_on":["[[28-df-propositional-proof-system]]","[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-conp]]","[[28-thm-cook-levin]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-verifier]]"],"source_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp — 多项式长命题证明与 NP=coNP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6f4ddd360c890dee\" href=\"?note=6f4ddd360c890dee\" title=\"28-df-propositional-proof-system\">28-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"24770f8178ebaeed\" href=\"?note=24770f8178ebaeed\" title=\"28-df-conp\">28-df-conp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0fc90210de59068\" href=\"?note=e0fc90210de59068\" title=\"28-thm-cook-levin\">28-thm-cook-levin</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"77951782409bcade\" href=\"?note=77951782409bcade\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-verifier\">28-df-polynomial-time-verifier</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{coNP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{coNP}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"24770f8178ebaeed\" href=\"?note=24770f8178ebaeed\" title=\"28-df-conp\">28-df-conp</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofSys},\\operatorname{PolyBounded},\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProofSys},\\operatorname{PolyBounded},\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6f4ddd360c890dee\" href=\"?note=6f4ddd360c890dee\" title=\"28-df-propositional-proof-system\">28-df-propositional-proof-system</a>；采用固定有效的布尔公式编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\exists P\\;\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf{NP}=\\mathbf{coNP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\exists P\\;\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf{NP}=\\mathbf{coNP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：正向中，猜测长度多项式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 并算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(\\pi)\">\\(P(\\pi)\\)</span> 即使 TAUT 属于 NP；TAUT 对 coNP 的完全性由 SAT 的 NP 完全性以及公式取否得到，遂有 coNP 包含于 NP，取补后两者相等。反向中，TAUT 属于 NP，取其多项式验证器；机器解析输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(y,w)\">\\((y,w)\\)</span>，验证通过则输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，否则输出固定永真式。该总函数在证明输入长度的多项式时间内运行，且所有永真式有多项式长证书，故多项式有界。此为本地论证，原书 pp.307–309 的短证书讨论是背景，未冒称书中编号定理。</p>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n<p>R6依赖证据复核：证明系统互构已复核，TAUT的coNP完全性使用Cook–Levin受限证明。本地推导记录保留；完整结论当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"6f4ddd360c890dee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-propositional-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-conp","status":"resolved","id":"24770f8178ebaeed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-conp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-cook-levin","status":"resolved","id":"e0fc90210de59068","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-cook-levin]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-verifier","status":"resolved","id":"77951782409bcade","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-verifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{coNP}$ 来自 [[28-df-np]]、[[28-df-conp]]。$\\operatorname{ProofSys},\\operatorname{PolyBounded},\\mathrm{TAUT}$ 来自 [[28-df-propositional-proof-system]]；采用固定有效的布尔公式编码。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-conp","status":"resolved","id":"24770f8178ebaeed","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{coNP}$ 来自 [[28-df-np]]、[[28-df-conp]]。$\\operatorname{ProofSys},\\operatorname{PolyBounded},\\mathrm{TAUT}$ 来自 [[28-df-propositional-proof-system]]；采用固定有效的布尔公式编码。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"6f4ddd360c890dee","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{coNP}$ 来自 [[28-df-np]]、[[28-df-conp]]。$\\operatorname{ProofSys},\\operatorname{PolyBounded},\\mathrm{TAUT}$ 来自 [[28-df-propositional-proof-system]]；采用固定有效的布尔公式编码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{coNP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProofSys},\\operatorname{PolyBounded},\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\\exists P\\;\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf{NP}=\\mathbf{coNP}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"P(\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"(y,w)","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false}],"bytes":1850,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-218","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第15章：证明复杂性：[[28-df-propositional-proof-system]]、[[28-thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp]]、[[28-df-resolution]]、[[28-thm-resolution-soundness-completeness]]、[[28-df-pigeonhole-cnf]]、[[28-thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["6f4ddd360c890dee","0cb5248561455df8","24770f8178ebaeed","e0fc90210de59068","77951782409bcade"]}